cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself (below)
  and the paper it was developed for (see preferred-citation).
title: BeamLab21
abstract: >-
  Beam computation / characterization tool for 21cm arrays, inspired by and
  tested on HIRAX. Decomposes a measured/simulated beam into a 2D Gaussian
  main lobe plus a Zernike-transform (Bessel) basis, and regenerates a beam
  model from saved coefficients.
